cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software release when using the code. For the associated article, cite its final published bibliographic record when available."
type: software
title: "Code for: Transfer Learning-Based Recurrent Neural Networks for Predicting Al(III) and Fe(III) Removal by Raw and Functionalized Silicas"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bbvizzotto-run/Adsorption-TL-paper"
abstract: >-
  Data-free code snapshot for an endpoint-prediction benchmark using LSTM and
  transfer learning for Al(III) and Fe(III) removal responses on raw and
  functionalized silicas. Experimental records and row-level outputs are not
  included; this software snapshot alone cannot reproduce the reported numeric
  results.
keywords:
  - adsorption
  - endpoint prediction
  - transfer learning
  - long short-term memory
  - aluminum
  - iron
  - silica
  - chemical engineering
